      "value": "@{5a3ad8ac4a8da67427803715|full_name}: \nI'm sorry for the misunderstanding.\nMy post is supposed to be different from Scarlet Crystal's one.\nHe is talking about avatars in the wing menu, which is for using the user’s avatar, while I am talking about clone public avatar button in the QM, which is for cloning another player’s using avatar.\nMy post is similar to https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1137-platform-support-indicator-missing-from-the-clone-avatar-button .",
